                    "type": "file",
                    "name": "index.html",
                    "data": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"de\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>BetaNet GmbH</title>\n  <style>\n    *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n    body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#222;font-size:14px}\n    header{background:#0a5c2f;color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n    header h1{font-size:1.3em}\n    header p{opacity:.75;font-size:.82em}\n    nav{background:#0e8a46;white-space:nowrap;overflow-x:auto}\n    nav a{display:inline-block;color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-size:.85em}\n    nav a:hover{background:#0a5c2f}\n    .hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a5c2f,#0e8a46);color:#fff;padding:24px 16px}\n    .hero h2{font-size:1.3em;margin-bottom:8px}\n    .hero p{opacity:.85;font-size:.88em}\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;padding:16px;background:#f0faf4}\n    .card{background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border-left:4px solid #0e8a46}\n    .card h3{color:#0a5c2f;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:.88em}\n    .card p{font-size:.82em;line-height:1.5}\n    .info{background:#d4edda;padding:9px 16px;font-size:.76em;color:#444;border-top:3px solid #0e8a46}\n    footer{background:#0a5c2f;color:#aaa;padding:9px 16px;font-size:.75em}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header>\n    <h1>BetaNet GmbH</h1>\n    <p>Internet-Provider &middot; AS65002</p>\n  </header>\n  <nav>\n    <a href=\"/\">Start</a>\n    <a href=\"#\">Privatkunden</a>\n    <a href=\"#\">Business</a>\n    <a href=\"#\">Netzwerk</a>\n    <a href=\"#\">Support</a>\n  </nav>\n  <div class=\"hero\">\n    <h2>Schnelles Internet für alle</h2>\n    <p>BetaNet betreibt ein eigenes AS (AS65002) und ist über den BGP-Backbone verbunden.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Breitband-Anschlüsse</h3>\n      <p>Für Privat- und Geschäftskunden &mdash; IPv4 und IPv6 inklusive.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>E-Mail-Dienste</h3>\n      <p>alice, bob, admin &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:support@betanet.de\">support@betanet.de</a></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>Rechenzentrum DC-Beta</h3>\n      <p>Server im eigenen DC, direkt im AS65002 geroutet.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3>BGP-Netz</h3>\n      <p>Backbone-Router BB3 &mdash; global erreichbar über AS65002.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"info\">IPv4: 185.2.1.10 &nbsp;|&nbsp; IPv6: 2001:db8:2:1::10 &nbsp;|&nbsp; AS65002</div>\n  <footer>&copy; 2026 BetaNet GmbH &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Alle Rechte vorbehalten</footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
                    "binary": false,
